/// Extracts telemetry from an MCP `CallToolResult`'s metadata and records the
/// allowlisted fields as span attributes.
///
/// Navigates `result.meta["codex/telemetry"]["span"]`. Only `target_id` (a
/// non-empty string) and `did_trigger_server_user_flow` (a boolean) are
/// promoted to span attributes; all other keys and mismatched value types are
